    "description": {
      "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><div><div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Creature Type\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"> 進行攻擊檢定，屬性檢定，或豁免檢定時，你可以在檢定中加入一顆 d4。你能在看到d20骰值後。但該次檢定的效應還沒處理前再決定是否使用這一特質。你能使用此特質次數等同於 你的熟練加值 次，完成一次長休後，你重獲所有已消耗的使用次數。</span></p></div></div></div><p>You can add a [[/r d4]] to one attack roll, ability check, or saving throw you make, and you can do so after seeing the [[/r d20]] roll but before the effects of the roll are resolved. You can use this trait a number of times equal to your proficiency bonus, and you regain all expended uses when you finish a long rest.</p></div>",
